OL,3,GNEWSASix arrests after gunshots fired
OL,4,Ain street
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of affray in connection with
OL,8,Fthe incident. The area was cordoned off
OL,9,Fand police remained at the scene on
OL,10,FSaturday, while investigations
OL,11,Fcontinue.
